    ARRAY[]::text[],
    NULL,
    NULL,
    NULL,
    '-	I am passionate about promoting the green transition from renewable sources, energy efficiency, decarbonization solutions besides sustainability ESG approaches that create the positive driver of climate actions.
-	Extensive engagement with REDD+, ESG/Sustainability strategy and reports, GHG inventories, Energy and carbon data collection and benchmarking, Net Zero roadmap, LCA/CBAM/EURD compliance.  Familiar with international sustainability and gender equality frameworks, including the SDGs and gender mainstreaming principles in ESG and sustainable procurement.
-	Climate project developer and ESG/Carbon expert with more than 15 years of extensive experience across diverse industries and collaborations, I have assumed various roles from import/export and business development manager, consultant to an expert in green transitions and ESG strategies in multiple sectors including oil and gas, renewable energy, industrial - agricultural products, climate projects that aim a low-carbon economy as well as reduce climate change impacts.
-	Strong experience in working with private sector clients, government agencies, and international organizations to design bankable green projects and integrate ESG into business strategy.
-	Actively engaged in capacity building on ISO IWA48, 14064, 14067, 14068, GHG Protocol, ISO 46001, 27001, 27701, 37001, 30414, 20400, stakeholder engagement, and policy dialogue to accelerate green transition and sustainable finance in emerging economies.
-	I hold an MBA and 2 Bachelors of Foreign Trade and Law as well as continuously improve related knowledge such as energy transition, Hydrogen PtX, carbon accounting, global carbon market, low carbon energy sources, ESG/ Due diligence, circular economy.',
